        testing: 'A confident, senior-level introduction centered on migration and architecture experience.',
        answer: `<strong>Sample script, replace the brackets with your facts:</strong> "I am [Name], a frontend developer with six years of experience, mainly with <code>Vue.js</code> and <code>TypeScript</code>. For the last [number] years I have worked in the telecom domain on a platform with three main domains: Self-care for customers, Agent for support and sales agents and Retail for store users. The frontend is built as micro-frontends, and one of them, the Agent application, runs inside Salesforce. I was part of [or led] the migration from <code>Vue 2</code> to <code>Vue 3</code>, where we [short result, such as moved each application incrementally, moved from Vuex to Pinia and from webpack to Vite]. I also worked on [shared components, performance, integration with APIs, testing]. I am now looking for a role with [larger ownership, architecture responsibility or a product focus], where I can use this experience further."<br><br>Keep it to about a minute and end with why you are interested in this role.`,
        mistake: 'Listing technologies without mentioning the domain, the architecture and your specific contribution to the migration.',
