        testing: 'Domain awareness and the ability to link it to engineering decisions.',
        answer: `Discuss what applies to your platform. Common themes: large and complex data such as plans, bundles, usage and billing that must be shown clearly; many roles and permissions, especially for agents and retail staff; high reliability expectations because customers depend on the service; accuracy and auditability of actions such as activations and plan changes; multiple channels with different devices and network quality; sensitive personal data, which requires careful handling and privacy-safe logging; integrations with several backend and third-party systems with variable response times; and multi-language support. Explain how your architecture, testing and error handling addressed one or two of these.`,
