        testing: 'A clear, concise 60 to 90 second summary of who you are professionally, with relevant strengths.',
        answer: `Use this structure: present, past, future. Replace every bracket with your real details.<br><br><strong>Sample script:</strong> "Hi, I am [Name], a frontend developer with [5+] years of experience. Currently I work at [Company], where I build [type of application] using <code>Vue.js</code>, <code>Nuxt</code>, <code>TypeScript</code> and <code>Tailwind CSS</code>. My main areas are reusable components, API integration, performance and responsive, accessible interfaces. Earlier I worked on [short earlier experience], where I started with <code>JavaScript</code> and <code>Vue 2</code> and later helped migrate to <code>Vue 3</code>. Some work I am proud of is [one concrete achievement, such as improving page load or building a component library]. I am now looking for a role with [bigger ownership, more complex architecture, a product focus] and I think this position fits that goal."<br><br>Keep it to about a minute, mention only what is relevant to the role and end with why you are here.`,
