        answer: `Focus on what you want to gain, not on what you dislike. Choose a reason that is true for you.<br><br><strong>Sample script:</strong> "I have been at [Company] for [duration] and I have learned a lot, including [specific skills]. I am grateful for that experience. Now I want to take the next step in my career: [for example, work on larger-scale products, take more ownership of architecture, learn new technologies, or work in a product-focused team]. In my current role the opportunities in this direction are limited at the moment, so I decided to look for a role where I can grow further. This position looks like a good match because [specific reason related to the company or role]."<br><br>Other honest reasons: a role with more responsibility, a different domain, learning opportunities, better work-life balance or a company mission you care about.`,
