        answer: `Prepare before the interview: read the company website, product, technology blog and job description, and connect them to your skills.<br><br><strong>Sample script:</strong> "I looked into [Company] and I like that [specific product, mission, engineering culture or technology]. The role needs <code>Vue</code>, <code>Nuxt</code> and <code>TypeScript</code>, which is exactly what I have worked with for [years]. I am also interested in [specific challenge, such as scale, performance, design system or accessibility] because I have experience with [relevant example] and I want to go deeper. I believe I can contribute quickly and also grow with the team."<br><br>Be specific. A generic answer such as "it is a good company" does not help.`,
