        answer: `Reproduce with a keyboard and at least one screen reader before changing code. Check that the dialog has a role and accessible name, that focus moves into it on open, that Tab stays within it, that Escape or a labeled close control works and that focus returns to the trigger. Verify the background is not reachable, using the native dialog element with <code>showModal()</code> where possible or an inert background otherwise. Because users are blocked, ship the focused fix quickly, then add tests and a review checklist so the same component serves every modal in the product.`,
