        verification: 'Test disconnects, duplicate and missed events, tab backgrounding and load at the expected user count. Monitor connection counts and reconnect rates after launch.',
        mistake: 'Choosing WebSockets by default and then discovering the dashboard only needed a one-way stream.',
        followupQ: 'How do you recover from a gap in events?',
