        mistake: 'Assuming search engines will execute everything perfectly and promptly, without checking what they actually index.',
        followupQ: 'How would you avoid this in a future migration?',
        followupA: 'Plan SEO requirements up front, keep a URL and redirect map, test crawl output before launch and release gradually while monitoring search metrics.',
